  "description": "Analyzes PrincipalObjectAccess (record-level sharing) by table and principal: decodes access rights, flags excessive and stale shares (inactive users, disabled/empty teams, outlier records, inbound access sprawl), shows a table x principal intensity view, and previews cleanup recommendations. Read-only, with an exportable sharing report (Excel, PDF, JSON, HTML, CSV).",
